['austria-kaiserschmarrn','Kaiserschmarrn (Austrian Shredded Pancake with Plum Compote)','Austria','🇦🇹',45,['wheat flour','milk','egg','sugar','butter','raisins','plum compote'],[[70,'g'],[120,'ml'],[2,'piece'],[20,'g'],[15,'g'],[20,'g'],[60,'g']],'https://www.austria.info/en-gb/recipes/kaiserschmarren/',['Whisk flour, milk, egg yolks, and half the sugar into a smooth batter.','Beat the egg whites until firm and fold them in gently with the raisins.','Cook the batter in butter until golden underneath, turn, and finish cooking.','Tear into pieces, caramelise with the remaining sugar, and serve with plum compote.']],
['austria-apfelstrudel','Wiener Apfelstrudel (Viennese Apple and Cinnamon Strudel)','Austria','🇦🇹',70,['strudel pastry','apple','raisins','breadcrumbs','butter','sugar','cinnamon'],[[100,'g'],[220,'g'],[20,'g'],[25,'g'],[20,'g'],[25,'g'],[0.5,'tsp']],'https://www.austria.info/en-gb/recipes/apple-strudel/',['Toast breadcrumbs in half the butter until golden and cool them.','Mix thinly sliced apple with raisins, sugar, and cinnamon.','Spread breadcrumbs and filling over the pastry, fold the sides, and roll firmly.','Brush with butter and bake at 180°C until crisp and golden.']],
['austria-sachertorte','Sachertorte (Viennese Chocolate and Apricot Cake)','Austria','🇦🇹',60,['dark chocolate','butter','sugar','egg','wheat flour','apricot jam'],[[55,'g'],[25,'g'],[35,'g'],[1,'piece'],[30,'g'],[25,'g']],'https://www.austria.info/en-gb/recipes/sachertorte/',['Melt half the chocolate and beat the butter with part of the sugar until light.','Mix in the egg yolk and chocolate, then fold in whipped egg white and flour.','Bake in a small tin at 180°C, cool, split, and spread with apricot jam.','Melt the remaining chocolate into a smooth glaze and coat the cake.']],
['austria-tiroler-grostl','Tiroler Gröstl (Tyrolean Potato, Beef, and Egg Fry-Up)','Austria','🇦🇹',35,['potato','cooked beef','onion','bacon','egg','butter','parsley'],[[220,'g'],[100,'g'],[70,'g'],[35,'g'],[1,'piece'],[15,'g'],[5,'g']],'https://www.austria.info/en-gb/inspiration/culinary-tirol/',['Boil the potato until just tender, cool slightly, and slice it.','Brown bacon and onion in butter, then add potato and crisp the edges.','Fold in sliced cooked beef and heat it thoroughly without drying it out.','Fry the egg separately, place it on top, and finish with parsley.']],
['austria-kasespatzle','Käsespätzle (Alpine Cheese Noodles with Fried Onion)','Austria','🇦🇹',40,['wheat flour','egg','milk','mountain cheese','onion','butter','chives'],[[100,'g'],[1,'piece'],[45,'ml'],[70,'g'],[70,'g'],[15,'g'],[5,'g']],'https://www.austria.info/en-gb/inspiration/mountain-huts/',['Beat flour, egg, milk, and a pinch of salt into a thick elastic batter.','Press small noodles into simmering water and cook until they float.','Drain and layer the hot noodles with grated mountain cheese.','Brown sliced onion in butter, spoon it over the noodles, and add chives.']],
['austria-frittatensuppe','Frittatensuppe (Austrian Pancake-Strip Beef Broth)','Austria','🇦🇹',30,['wheat flour','milk','egg','beef stock','butter','chives','nutmeg'],[[45,'g'],[90,'ml'],[1,'piece'],[350,'ml'],[8,'g'],[5,'g'],[0.25,'tsp']],'https://contentdb.austria.info/assets/pdf/4890b44b-3384-466a-8935-25691b911cbb/original/genuss_e_book_oesterreich_2020_2.pdf',['Whisk flour, milk, egg, nutmeg, and salt into a thin batter.','Cook a very thin pancake in butter and let it cool briefly.','Roll the pancake and slice it into fine strips.','Heat the beef stock, add the strips just before serving, and scatter with chives.']],
['austria-marillenknodel','Marillenknödel (Wachau Apricot Dumplings)','Austria','🇦🇹',60,['quark cheese','wheat flour','egg','butter','apricot','breadcrumbs','sugar'],[[80,'g'],[60,'g'],[0.5,'piece'],[20,'g'],[2,'piece'],[30,'g'],[20,'g']],'https://www.austria.info/en-gb/recipes/apricot-dumplings/',['Mix quark, flour, egg, and half the butter into a soft dough and chill it.','Enclose each pitted apricot completely in an even layer of dough.','Simmer the dumplings gently until cooked through and floating.','Toast breadcrumbs with butter and sugar and roll the drained dumplings in them.']],
['austria-backhendl','Wiener Backhendl (Viennese Crispy Breaded Chicken)','Austria','🇦🇹',45,['chicken thigh','wheat flour','egg','breadcrumbs','lemon','vegetable oil','parsley'],[[220,'g'],[25,'g'],[1,'piece'],[50,'g'],[0.25,'piece'],[250,'ml'],[5,'g']],'https://www.austria.info/en-us/inspiration/recipes/',['Season and dry the chicken, then coat it with flour, beaten egg, and breadcrumbs.','Heat the oil in a deep pan to about 170°C.','Fry the chicken in batches until crisp, golden, and safely cooked at the centre.','Drain well and serve with lemon and parsley.']],
['austria-karntner-kasnudeln','Kärntner Kasnudeln (Carinthian Cheese and Potato Pasta Parcels)','Austria','🇦🇹',80,['wheat flour','egg','potato','quark cheese','onion','butter','mint'],[[100,'g'],[1,'piece'],[130,'g'],[80,'g'],[40,'g'],[20,'g'],[3,'g']],'https://www.austria.info/en-us/recipes/cheese-ravioli/',['Knead flour, egg, water, and salt into a smooth pasta dough and rest it.','Mix mashed potato, quark, softened onion, and mint into a firm filling.','Roll the dough thin, fill and fold the parcels, and crimp the edges securely.','Simmer until tender, drain carefully, and spoon browned butter over them.']],
['austria-germknodel','Germknödel (Steamed Yeast Dumpling with Plum Filling)','Austria','🇦🇹',70,['wheat flour','milk','yeast','sugar','butter','plum jam','poppy seeds'],[[110,'g'],[65,'ml'],[3,'g'],[20,'g'],[15,'g'],[35,'g'],[15,'g']],'https://www.austria.info/en-gb/inspiration/mountain-huts/',['Mix warm milk, yeast, sugar, flour, and butter into a soft dough and let it rise.','Flatten the dough, enclose the plum jam, and seal it into a round dumpling.','Proof again, then steam until puffed and cooked through.','Serve hot with melted butter, ground poppy seeds, and a little sugar.']]
